Source: tlosint-archive-keyring
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Trace Labs VM Team <vm-team@tracelabs.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://apt.tracelabs.org

Package: tlosint-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: OpenPGP archive key of the Trace Labs OSINT apt repository
 The repository at apt.tracelabs.org signs its Release files with this key.
 Installed as /usr/share/keyrings/tlosint-archive-keyring.gpg, for use in
 the Signed-By field of the repository's apt source.
 .
 Shipping the key as a package lets a replacement signing subkey reach
 users through a normal upgrade, before the old one is retired.
